  "content": "<h1>Ресурспак меняет модели и текстуры большинства животных <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dragn-livestock-overhaul\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dragn's Livestock Overhaul</a>, чтобы они выглядели более реалистично и соответствовали реальным цветовымPatternам!</h1>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>ДОМАШНИЕ ЖИВOTНЫЕ:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Куры:<br>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>Американа:</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1590568/description_65f020f2-3e18-4a61-b9f4-84f5f1de83ee.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Аям Цемяни:</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1590568/description_df45e0a6-6d33-4837-9ee0-465482b55ff6.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Брама:</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1590568/description_86f56119-3951-4442-bdce-ce0e2d8f6c58.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Леггорн:</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1590568/description_f4ac4eec-7f02-466c-b4d9-88f1277cf97e.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Маранс:</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1590568/description_1afef700-0f31-4eca-8784-17b572037126.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Орпингтон:</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1590568/description_17bf7df7-a72b-4406-abf8-5337d09ff8bb.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Полис:</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1590568/description_89edd935-99aa-4050-b176-63262d509f31.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Уандотт:</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1590568/description_c7c0195c-7bd1-4fc4-87ef-b0d44a34a80e.png\"></p>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>Коровы:<br>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>Ангус:</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1590568/description_7342f75b-3b40-48d5-9399-fcb5798dd8be.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Брахман:</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1590568/description_cab91467-816d-453c-936e-b2fdf91ba380.png\"></p>\n<p>Херфорд:</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1590568/description_cb590e9f-473e-4dda-ba33-686b275ebb35.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Хайленд:</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1590568/description_1fa2db30-3383-4cb0-bdfd-3bbf22bfb2a7.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Холштейн:</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1590568/description_2b3ec38d-a57b-4c64-8d5c-c25e5116110c.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Jерси:</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1590568/description_7666e582-76ce-40cc-9a54-72dfb30c159b.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Лонгорн:</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1590568/description_269a6943-d5cd-450c-87c5-4d0c7a0ac278.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Ватуси:</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1590568/description_10f558e8-547a-43d6-a603-9cdf37adabe4.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Испанская бойцовая:</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1590568/description_826d6403-aa7a-4fbc-a558-7cba082b0306.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Быки:</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1590568/description_e328b54e-bffd-4cfa-97ff-93d42568da9b.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>Моошrooms и Мооблоумы:<br>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>Мооблоумы урожая:</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1590568/description_575ef9de-e8cd-449f-bfd0-976af619f31a.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Мооблоумы цветов:</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1590568/description_b647e48c-e460-4e25-8b28-7949794bdf49.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Моошрумсы:</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1590568/description_d48a681b-dc8f-4812-baea-ae552b9f7e1e.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>Свиньи:<br>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>Кожа вепря:</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1590568/description_e28075e8-e961-4f7d-8f2e-b9785efcdefe.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Домашняя кожа свиньи:</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1590568/description_8465119d-3c6c-46d8-966d-b7d222a3cccc.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Пятнистые вепри:</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1590568/description_17f084fc-6452-4d65-9fd4-b2069b356cf6.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Пятнистые свиньи:</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1590568/description_a9114bee-cf89-4bb2-9db5-524e153c4b19.png\"></p>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>Овцы:&nbsp;<br>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>Светлые цвета:</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1590568/description_92db7f78-d568-4d5a-8d7d-b12f1ae91397.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Темные цвета:</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1590568/description_d509fe61-e375-4af0-ab5c-072cc0af6db5.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Шерстяные овцы (без шерсти):</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1590568/description_439cc559-afbf-49e0-acf5-5c9b9aca1bd8.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Якоб и Ракка:</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1590568/description_d2197234-d2c4-46d8-ad1f-f5eec169e2aa.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>Фермерские козы и Горные козы:<br>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>Фермерские козы:</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1590568/description_24c2cd0d-7372-4b29-ab4c-005eef555d83.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1590568/description_72b7bd3d-6dbc-4743-ac78-850bcf4dafe4.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Горные козы:</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1590568/description_3e168be0-3f48-44b7-9611-300c977f3dfe.png\"></p>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>Lламы и Камели:<br>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>Лламы:</p>\n<p><img src=\"\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1590568/description_29506d72-2c2e-4758-b21a-152b124e8aaf.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Камели:</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1590568/description_670a0a64-e9d8-4ac6-b894-00ca74bf151b.png\"></p>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>Лошадью:<br>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>Разнообразие лошадей:</p>\n<p><img src=\"\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1590568/description_d7226028-d78b-4e9b-8865-610d0f0ec42a.png\"></p>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>Мулы и Ослы:<br>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>Oслы:</p>\n<p><img src=\"\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1590568/description_50c445bb-1568-461b-a7cd-d1ed9c32c671.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Мулы:</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1590568/description_85dc05d5-48e2-48e6-b5fc-d225cebda390.png\"></p>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>Олени и Кролики:<br>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>Олени:</p>\n<p><img src=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1590568/description_b28b0d8e-e39e-491b-b564-7c5d7b088b8f.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Кролики:</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1590568/description_7a2e68dc-cddc-4530-a7a5-3d51cd9d2329.png\"><img src=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>ДОМАШНИЕ ЖИВОТНЫЕ:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Собаки, Волки и Лисы:<br>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>Собаки:</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1590568/description_814348a6-613b-4660-9b58-6a1df2f9c4bd.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Волки:</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1590568/description_bfefc74c-e65c-4a05-9fee-f6bfce958812.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Лисы:</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1590568/description_5bc12b63-8505-4b18-82bd-cfca959c9c8b.png\"></p>\n</div>\n</li>\n</ul>",
